# jsdom 30.1.x breaks vitest 5.0.3: every test file fails to start with
#   TypeError: 'addEventListener' called on an object that is not a valid
#   instance of EventTarget (vitest catchWindowErrors -> jsdom EventTarget).
# Held at ~30.0.1 (tested 2026-10-06: 30.1.2 fails). Re-test when a newer
# jsdom or vitest release lands.
jsdom
